  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-5684" textLabel="CPLX-5684" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-5684" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="450" centerY="215" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>The &lt;i&gt;PYD3&lt;/i&gt; gene from &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; encoding an enzyme with &amp;beta;-ureidopropionase activity was isolated and expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt;. The recombinant protein was shown to convert &amp;beta;-ureidopropionate into &amp;beta;-alanine. The specific activity of the recombinant enzyme was determined at 30 nmol.min&lt;sup&gt;-1&lt;/sup&gt;.mg&lt;sup&gt;-1&lt;/sup&gt; protein at a substrate concentration of 8 &amp;mu;M |CITS:[11161056]|. Size exclusion chromatography indicated that the molecular mass of the recombinant enzyme at pH 7.3 was around 400 kDa. At pH 5.6 in the absence of glycerol a single peak of approximately 90 kDa was found, corresponding to the dimeric form of the enzyme. Native PAGE analysis on the other hand showed three high molecular mass bands which contained a single 43 kDa band by SDS-PAGE. These experiments suggest a high degree of aggregation of the protein |CITS:[11161056]|. Based on analyses of similar proteins from other species, it is likely that this enzyme functions in thymine degradation (reductive) and can also lead to the production of |FRAME: 3-AMINO-ISOBUTYRATE| from |FRAME: 3-UREIDO-ISOBUTYRATE| |CITS: [19413687]|, but, this has not been verified &lt;i&gt;in vivo&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt;.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-5684" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT5G64370-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="1" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-9743" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="CPLX-*" />
      <Property key="MolecularWeightExp" value="400." />
      <Property key="MolecularWeightKd" value="400." />
      <Property key="Pi" value="6.2" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_11161056" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_19413687" />
    </Group>
  </Groups>
